/E (Bjorka A user identified on multiple cybercriminal forums \(BreachForums, RaidForums\) and linked to the Babuk2 operation in 2025 - a data leak site that appeared to publish mostly recycled data already leaked by other groups. Bjorka has been linked to the DragonForce operation via a database leaked from BreachForums that had Bjorka email \(bjorkaact\) listed as the username for the DragonForce profile.)
